1. Nvidia's moat is CUDA, a programming layer 15 years in the making, not its hardware.
2. Switching away from CUDA requires rewriting every AI model trained in the last decade.
3. Jensen Huang bet the company on CUDA in 2006 when GPU computing had no market.
</key_insights>

