Tension: Platform openness vs. platform control — Nvidia benefits from CUDA's ubiquity
but open alternatives would erode the lock-in that makes it valuable.
Unresolved: Can any company maintain a proprietary software layer once the
underlying hardware becomes a commodity?
</core_tensions>

